{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1451455-new-book-of-nod","id":1451455,"title":"New Book of Nod?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-06-09T10:24:35-07:00","id":1451455,"title":"New Book of Nod?","content":"Does anyone know if the new Book of Nod will be like The Erciyes Fragment (i.e., a new version) or just a reprint of the old one?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-09T10:55:47-07:00","id":1451460,"title":"","content":"I didn't know there was going to be a new book. When was this announced?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-09T13:17:46-07:00","id":1451479,"title":"","content":"If there was an announcement, I missed it, but would love to be brought up to speed if anyone has a link to one.<br /> <br /> I'd be surprised if V5 touched the Book of Nod at all. I read the epilogue to Beckett's Jyhad Diary as a coda on the whole idea of Gehenna. I read Beckett's &quot;don't worry about Gehenna, focus on your relationships with the people close to you at ground level&quot; message as speaking directly from the developers.<br /> <br /> I mean, my heart wants to tell me that he was writing under the influence of the coffin inhabitant's Dominate, but my head tells me otherwise.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11599,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11599-reasor","user":"Reasor","date":". 06-09-2021, 05:24 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11599-reasor","name":"Reasor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-09T16:22:35-07:00","id":1451510,"title":"","content":"Likely just a reprint, since they're also doing the reprints of the core/Cam/Anarch as well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1808-elmerg","name":"elmerg","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"539"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-09T23:31:04-07:00","id":1451527,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Grumpy RPG Reviews</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1451455-new-book-of-nod?p=1451460#post1451460\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I didn't know there was going to be a new book. When was this announced?</div> </div> </div> </div>I could've sworn it was in Justin's Twitch interview about V5 (but maybe it was in the chat).<br /> <br /> On a related note, is the new ST Screen/Toolkit just a reprint with new artwork and a fixed BP table, or is it something else? It otherwise looks the same to me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-10T22:31:45-07:00","id":1451614,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>adambeyoncelowe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1451455-new-book-of-nod?p=1451527#post1451527\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I could've sworn it was in Justin's Twitch interview about V5 (but maybe it was in the chat).<br /> <br /> On a related note, is the new ST Screen/Toolkit just a reprint with new artwork and a fixed BP table, or is it something else? It otherwise looks the same to me.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yes, Justin mentioned it during his interview with Outstart, but didn't further elaborate whether it was a reprint or a brand new version.<br /> <br /> As for the St Screen, looking at it I suppose it's just a fix, it really seems the same thing","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12590-manfr","name":"Manfr","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"449"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-11T09:13:05-07:00","id":1451677,"title":"","content":"So re: the ST screen and new core book at least, I asked Renegade on FB and they said...<br /> <br /> Re: The new core book<br /> <span style=\"color:#050505\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">The new core book will include the Companion Errata but not all Companion content.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> Re: the screen<br /> <span style=\"color:#050505\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">One table was changed to a Clan Discipline reference but there are not errata'd charts.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> I have asked them now about the Book of Nod reprint, so we'll see what they say. Will post when I find out.<br /> <br /> ETA: They're cheeky today. They told me 'stay tuned to the streams and site' from the con this weekend for the full V5 news. Since the Book isn't 'officially' announced, I guess we'll get those details this weekend.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1808,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1808-elmerg","user":"elmerg","date":". 06-11-2021, 12:22 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1808-elmerg","name":"elmerg","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"539"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-11T10:36:39-07:00","id":1451688,"title":"","content":"I wonder, how much they would bother to change the original Book of Nod? A different point of view was covered by the Revelations of the Dark Mother, and the Erciyes Fragments. What else could they do that has not already been done?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-11T16:42:59-07:00","id":1451773,"title":"","content":"According to what was said tonight, it's a deluxe reprint.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://renegadegamestudios.com/blog/announcing-four-new-products-for-vampire-the-masquerade-5th-edition/?fbclid=IwAR30T-EZQjDZI8bfTKLQp6U7KdAUZvsrJXG8i8Afp7edjXc30F3CFJ5Uf24\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-kftzvkkgjv/product_images/uploaded_images/vamp-book-nod-web-banner-1140x441-preorder-1-.jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://renegadegamestudios.com/blog/announcing-four-new-products-for-vampire-the-masquerade-5th-edition/?fbclid=IwAR30T-EZQjDZI8bfTKLQp6U7KdAUZvsrJXG8i8Afp7edjXc30F3CFJ5Uf24\" target=\"_blank\"> Announcing four new products for Vampire: The Masquerade 5th Edition! </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://renegadegamestudios.com/blog/announcing-four-new-products-for-vampire-the-masquerade-5th-edition/?fbclid=IwAR30T-EZQjDZI8bfTKLQp6U7KdAUZvsrJXG8i8Afp7edjXc30F3CFJ5Uf24\" target=\"_blank\"> https://renegadegamestudios.com/blog/announcing-four-new-products-for-vampire-the-masquerade-5th-edition/?fbclid=IwAR30T-EZQjDZI8bfTKLQp6U7KdAUZvsrJXG8i8Afp7edjXc30F3CFJ5Uf24 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Test Today as part of our Elysium: Weekend of Darkness activities we're announcing four new products for Vampire: The Masquerade Roleplaying Game 5th Edition that you can expect to see in stores later this year. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1808-elmerg","name":"elmerg","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"539"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-11T20:59:57-07:00","id":1451798,"title":"","content":"Okay, the announcement makes the new printing make sense. A hardcover edition to use as an in-game prop, and a deluxe edition that comes with more props. I wouldn't expect any new lore additions or retcons, but this edition could have a practical use that the PDF can't, for those that want it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11599-reasor","name":"Reasor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-11T23:03:51-07:00","id":1451804,"title":"","content":"I've got the original faux leather printing. This one sounds nifty but I'm not sure if it'll be worth buying again. The deluxe edition looks superb, but I'm not sure I can plonk $250 on a book I already have, and I wouldn't have the room for a crate with parchment scrolls and a stone tablet. It's pretty cool, though.<br /> <br /> Re: the screen, it seems weird they'd not change the revised Blood Potency table. Unless that's what you meant by the Discipline chart maybe? After all, if they're incorporating that into the V5 reprint, it would make sense to make the screen and core book align.<br /> <br /> Renegade seems to be a wise choice to replace Modiphius. They already have four new items available for pre-order. I just wish they'd sort out international postage already.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-12T01:11:44-07:00","id":1451811,"title":"","content":"Speaking of this book, I remember some foreshadowings are never recovered, even in original ending book Gehenna\u2026<br /> <br /> For example Chronicle of Shadows says Caine\u2019s childers (2nd and 3rd? Or 3rd and 4th? Who knows) wanted to consume him, so they chased through \u201cpool of Veyd-sah-me\u201d and finally met him in \u201ccave of Shal-ka-mense\u201d. Iirc this story and these locations only appear here. Old stuff always have many pits which may never be solved, hope V5 may make it better.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24560-rock113","name":"Rock113","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24560_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-12T06:51:12-07:00","id":1451837,"title":"","content":"I believe Shal-ka-mense was mentioned in &quot;World of Darkness&quot; 1sr ed. Don't remember it exactly, something about &quot;under the rushing waters&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2471-trollroot","name":"Trollroot","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"311"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-12T07:06:29-07:00","id":1451843,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>adambeyoncelowe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1451455-new-book-of-nod?p=1451804#post1451804\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've got the original faux leather printing. This one sounds nifty but I'm not sure if it'll be worth buying again. The deluxe edition looks superb, but I'm not sure I can plonk $250 on a book I already have, and I wouldn't have the room for a crate with parchment scrolls and a stone tablet. It's pretty cool, though.<br /> <br /> Re: the screen, it seems weird they'd not change the revised Blood Potency table. Unless that's what you meant by the Discipline chart maybe? After all, if they're incorporating that into the V5 reprint, it would make sense to make the screen and core book align.<br /> <br /> Renegade seems to be a wise choice to replace Modiphius. They already have four new items available for pre-order. I just wish they'd sort out international postage already.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> The 'Discipline table' replacement sounds like a table is being replaced with a list of the Disciplines by clan. So Ventrue: Dom, Fort, Pres, etc. <br /> <br /> And I'm sure that's why they're pushing stuff through fast. Both to not look like the do-nothing Modiphius, and to get things rolling while they work on international shipping. If they don't have printers in the EU already, that's gonna take time to set up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1808-elmerg","name":"elmerg","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"539"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-12T08:41:37-07:00","id":1451863,"title":"","content":"I may have a post about BoN\u2019s foreshadowings which haven\u2019t solved, wait!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24560-rock113","name":"Rock113","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24560_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"720"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}